GTK 4 part of the Breeze theme (Breeze, Breeze-Dark), generated by breeze-gtk 6.8.3 (source tarball sha256
9b96db2c0dd1a6ca018f9bb1cea4ed0947f140cd30f2106d9652448202e47c50, https://invent.kde.org/plasma/breeze-gtk; licences
BSD-3-Clause and CC0-1.0). Copied unchanged from Fedora's breeze-gtk-gtk4 6.8.3-1: the gtk.css files and the 15 SVG
assets they use. Installed to /app/share/themes, so that gtk-theme-name=Breeze from the desktop's settings.ini works in
the sandbox. Breeze-Dark uses the same assets (copied at install).
